se bounded to genuine topology problems, so unnecessary orchestration is not indicated here.","limitations":["The active bundle justifies a sentence-scoped patch path and verification route, but it does not itself identify the exact stale sentence or exact target file; keeping `minimal_patch_targets` empty is the safest non-speculative reading.","No executed replay artifact is present in the bundle; replay packets are exposed only as escalation routes if the task shifts from document parity to assembled replay proof.","`CODEX_RUNTIME_GUIDE.md` contains a packet-floor ownership reference to `PROMPT_guideline`, but that branch is not required for this narrow stale-owner-sentence fix path."]}
